erif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">목적 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">국가근로장학금 일반유형 추가신청기간을 마련하여 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1,2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">차 통합신청기간 중 장학금 미신청자 구제</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">해당 기간에 신청한 학생은 국가근로장학금 일반유형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일반교내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일반교외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">및 하계방학집중근로 프로그램</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">추후 희망근로지 신청 필수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">참여 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: <b>2026. 4. 24.(</b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) 09:00 ~ 5. 13.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">시까지</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: 2026</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 국가근로장학금 일반유형 근로를 희망하는 학</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">생</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">자격요건 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">해당학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(2026</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학자금 지원구간이 산정된 학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b>*</b></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">에 한하여 추가 신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b>*</b>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">해당 학기 국가장학금 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">국가근로장학금 미신청 상태로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학자금 지원구간이 기 산정되어있는 경우</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic,